{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c5e651a8d752635095b18a40b79e6400d220982644ec5fca9a77b886a9e3a4",
      "text": "我也收到了同样的信哦。\n所以就急忙赶来事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a83604bcc2a80f4311ab5c6feeb8422d0e5d5c8b4dbcfd91b78fb1720c9ad9c0",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n……咦？停在实先生肩膀上的是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0836c6d9698f0183b23fedd0570038f28198ab09235a249cb31b7799d855caab",
      "text": "是鸽子哦。\n我家的信是这孩子送来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3579d21bf52fc3ff39bc9a2c5027afaaa0bf116b6741dc8465b2e742cd76e80a",
      "text": "咕噜噜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e1e9c37de7d94158bbf3bded0bea0a271e6a4dbe035b6e846b2c660be091a96",
      "text": "乖哦乖哦。……大概是男极那边的鸽子吧，\n不过看样子已经彻底成为我的粉丝了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5084c198941b130ef0ce22d370c6768d9471aada33c0d6fc30c97b9c0c63d6",
      "text": "呵呵呵……面对这种挑战，\n身为男子汉怎么可能不热血沸腾呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:725044797536026fefc2109a4509a5c51706e1b945bbc86b01eb6751a520b89f",
      "text": "正合我意，就跟他们真刀真枪地干一场吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d528aac5aef8972705c191956f2b4c8c0fa81e1336519035431b55340ecd2f",
      "text": "哈哈。挺有活力嘛，渡边先生。\n连我都觉得心态要变年轻了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3c309aed6ed3105746147c063671cf594871e215f94b6170034e7c42180b1a5",
      "text": "就算变年轻了，真刀真枪这种词，\n我可说不太出口啊……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2997ea87722cf2bee664a64173dbf14084a7b8429c71bc59ceb8d2eb6066375",
      "text": "不，哎，正因如此，\n说不定反而是重拾热血青春的机会？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31fbec3ea2775728085b190dbd2ad3b546f2dd2e284268922f3d6c89f566e4ec",
      "text": "嗯。喜庆的气氛就到昨天为止了，山下君。\n一起朝着男极第一的目标奔跑吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:107cf1243a37c3027a1fb8de07d6fd3afb9b065ace221c254b156aa71cbc22bf",
      "text": "既然决定了，\n我这就去制定训练菜单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63e24fe2ff64a8b373fa31d46cd01427ca7905865cb08f4e6048b74801ea1da",
      "text": "我一定会把大家的气力与体力充分锻炼出来的，\n交给我吧，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000106:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43",
      "text": "就拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000106:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84ae730b84ebef438a4c70372062783707ecf360949e3c7ad6ebe39821ff138d",
      "text": "好嘞，大家！\n一起拿下‘男极KING’吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377",
      "text": "哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000172:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000182:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe176c7d7536e2d7cb9ef506ccfde4a99b6b068d364e3b7e1417ecfc94034f8",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000184:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc5aea847be026a7fdb170214370b3ba1b5085263411cca2921ed1df04bdf72d",
      "text": "今天我和实先生他们马上就开始了\n训练。现在正在休息。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000186:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04d6f993ab17f53498f43924b1a5c95a8860637e0658276c460c526a6d696657",
      "text": "虽然是结合了各自的课题制定的\n特训菜单……但总之非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000188:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0921c73aa279618322c95995831b3fb53376eed373ac392656fe73421643c30",
      "text": "简直就像同龄人在参加社团活动一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e41a325720f3e33ee2f5ef59b62007dcf50de7b88d217087db5c1be654ba377",
      "text": "训练\n请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000192:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed5874e8dad3cbcd1876dbdc172be6bf4bcde0cf2e8432b3b41442120d5ffad8",
      "text": "嗯，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000194:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4d7510bacfa6259dd624a56c7c34a9c80c4a5bac233925cb6948ee6cb074283",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー要是抽得出时间，\n也来看看我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000196:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e1569a83254bc819e90a68ccec5bf3707c3c06eea4112f589fa58ea83011b74",
      "text": "大家一定也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000199:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6ba9cc35efb5a83d26e69cd5c4b4e5a67cfdd323e943f77ed829712deb7db0",
      "text": "……啊，差不多该进行下一项训练了。\n那就先这样，●●●●プロデューサー。回聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_j:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6f79861cae08877ddecff22f9a676a19878e1c080ba24102894e5de5b3976a",
      "text": "各位，休息时间结束了！\n开始下一项特训吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
